<title>FINLAND: FINNISH NOV JOBLESS REPORT DUE DEC 18 0830.</title>
<headline>FINNISH NOV JOBLESS REPORT DUE DEC 18 0830.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Labour Ministry said in a statement on Wednesday it will release its November employment report on December 18 at 0830 (0630 GMT).  </p>
<p>Five economists' mean forecast for the November jobless rate is 17.3 percent in a 17.2-17.3 percent range. In October, the unemployment rate measured by the Labour Ministry  was 17.3 percent.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
